Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.91,0:00:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豬排豬排豬排飯!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.37,0:00:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬 我可以坐你旁邊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.63,0:00:26.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.94,0:00:27.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.87,0:00:32.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒看到沙司啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾 能幫我拿一瓶來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:34.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 3Q
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.93,0:00:54.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我夾!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.84,0:01:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個…真人你早就暴露了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:08.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你搶了謙吾很多塊豬排吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.24,0:01:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.18,0:01:15.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說嘛 我也在納悶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.24,0:01:18.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本來也只打算搶一塊的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過你那是怎麼搶都不見少的魔法豬排
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔法豬排?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才怪了 那是小毬同學的豬排啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.47,0:01:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事 我也吃不了那麼多
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.44,0:01:32.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.70,0:01:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬 不多吃點長不大的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你個白癡搞毛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.50,0:01:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就不覺得小毬總這麼客氣很可憐嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.09,0:01:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得可憐就把你自己的豬排分她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥 那我就不夠吃了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.39,0:01:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 別吵架 我夠吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.42,0:01:52.20,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,劍道大賽就要來了 我有必要補充營養
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:55.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你丫哪裡有必要繼續吃飯長個了…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你個蠢蛋 沒看到小毬醬很為難嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼狗屁魔法豬排
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:06.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給 小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給 鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.08,0:02:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多虧小毬同學 曾極度怕生的鈴也好轉了不少
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.90,0:04:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 小毬醬發郵件來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴也開始和小毬互發郵件了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:08.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地址是恭介幫忙登錄的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的郵件每次都很長 而且看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:13.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是暗號嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.95,0:04:16.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這封我該怎麼回覆?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.03,0:04:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 列儂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 是信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.19,0:04:23.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷之任務又來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次是什麼任務啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演場人偶劇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:30.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人偶劇?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:32.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.97,0:04:35.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 人偶劇要怎麼演啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.77,0:04:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要演?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然了 之前的任務全都完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:44.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的也搞定的話 對方就會告訴我們世界的秘密了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.44,0:04:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迷之信還會有多少封呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄信人真的有打算告訴我們世界的秘密嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:01.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們絕對是故意的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說不關我們事了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幹嘛撒謊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.86,0:05:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煩死了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.08,0:05:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎麼賠我們
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你們不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是就是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:14.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們故意用棒球擊中了小熊貓
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.65,0:05:16.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰故意了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好惡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們還正在演人偶劇來著
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.05,0:05:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人偶劇?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她說想在生日當天看人偶劇 所以我正演給她看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.05,0:05:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可人偶都成那樣了 沒法演下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼不能演
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你來演給她看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.25,0:05:40.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她期待了超久的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.50,0:05:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.05,0:05:44.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熊貓呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都破成那樣了誰還要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.40,0:05:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人偶劇 我來 給你們演
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會縫好它 然後給你們演人偶劇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們明天都過來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:05.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說定了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴完成任務的決心 看來不假
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:20.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬要演人偶劇?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一時腦熱 就應下來了…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那人偶劇你會演嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題啦 人偶劇會給大家帶來幸福哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.25,0:06:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啥事儘管問我吧 You
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你演過人偶劇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…應該要先編個故事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.02,0:06:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後根據故事製作人偶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.63,0:06:52.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要編故事嗎 我可不擅長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起來想嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些呢 是我編的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.86,0:07:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些全是小毬同學畫的啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.31,0:07:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某地有位企鵝先生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:14.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企鵝先生老是失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是男孩子女孩子與8個小矮人的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.76,0:07:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男孩子和女孩子會逐一解決8個小矮人的煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煩惱消除後小矮人就會消失
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:33.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會消失?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:34.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對男孩子和女孩子道完別後 就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.07,0:07:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會消失嗎 感覺有些傷感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之後的情節我還沒想過
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 那邊的三位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在打什麼壞主意呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.71,0:08:08.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我聞到了趣事爆發的氣味
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.10,0:08:12.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很吵耶 葉留佳很吵哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:15.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬要演人偶劇哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 人偶劇!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:20.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 人偶劇嗎 正好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.11,0:08:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我也正想著要演呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傾注於棒球的青春雖也不賴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.47,0:08:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶爾演出人偶劇也好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.60,0:08:30.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 你剛剛說啥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:34.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一天還要去文化館表演我們的人偶劇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.84,0:08:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在文化館演?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼演?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這還用問
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.90,0:08:45.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs30}與老人小孩以及各地區人民進行心靈交流也是Little Busters的重要任務
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.76,0:08:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢 這傢伙嘴裡的話就是有說服力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:50.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不…根本沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.53,0:08:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這我還是頭一次聽說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.23,0:08:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要演人偶劇嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:58.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 用來打發時間還不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.79,0:09:04.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我國本就有以人偶淨琉璃為開端的悠久歷史
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.02,0:09:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 先來編劇本吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.63,0:09:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼會搞成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,順著水推下舟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.17,0:09:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 大家完成了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我這個如何
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:56.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口水直淌 舔嘴唇的聲響迴盪在夜色小鎮裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:09:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫…暫停 別念了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼 這麼快就要提意見啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.94,0:10:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開頭的四個字太驚悚了…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:05.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有 挺有感覺的說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.41,0:10:07.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 你那種故事顯然不行
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.31,0:10:10.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒點熱血怎麼成
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想的是鐵啞鈴和鋼啞鈴的友情故事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.60,0:10:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了 鋼啞鈴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.43,0:10:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拋下我吧 我其實很清楚自己一直是大家的重負
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.12,0:10:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這麼說啊 鐵啞鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比你更重
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙 果然是白癡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡還是走傳統的童話路線吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,某地住著一對老夫婦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老爺爺上山砍柴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老奶奶在河邊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與觸手怪展開死鬥!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觸手怪!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.03,0:10:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:10:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,駁回啦 蠢蛋!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.57,0:11:02.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得這故事還挺感人的來著
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科幻動作路線怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新婚夫婦被外星人襲擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.43,0:11:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新婚夫婦被?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:12.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外星人…?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.00,0:11:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用現有的素材湊出了所有角色
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.10,0:11:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是新婚妻子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.85,0:11:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,故事從新婚家庭展開
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思 耍耍看吧 西園
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.40,0:11:31.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,親愛的 晚飯做好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 長官
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:36.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為今天吃漢堡肉 我下了一番功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:37.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勞煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:42.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,親愛的 洗澡水燒好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.44,0:11:43.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 長官
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好41度 不涼不燙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.25,0:11:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勞煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.07,0:11:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太厲害了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.16,0:11:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真的是美魚親嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.51,0:11:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.39,0:11:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.14,0:11:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耍得好 西園
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美魚醬好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.31,0:12:02.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就照這樣繼續吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在鬧什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈呀呀 風紀委員長駕到了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都到熄燈時間了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.54,0:12:12.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,校規就是校規 立刻回宿舍去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全員解散!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:31.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就是約好的日子了 鈴準備怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬同學?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹君 鈴醬有我跟著 放心放心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噓
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.16,0:13:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.82,0:13:15.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對哈 關係好就容易互相撞到頭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:19.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬 你來幫我的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:22.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 想兩人一起努力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還準備了曲奇和鹹海苔薯片
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.03,0:13:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企鵝先生的故事結局是怎樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企鵝先生很努力 不過幹什麼都不順利
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.21,0:13:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總是被小貓先生小狗先生和浣熊先生嘲笑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.56,0:13:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過啊 最後星星會讓它坐到自己的背上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.42,0:13:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它一邊坐著星星劃過天空一邊向大家揮手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.12,0:13:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這故事我喜歡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很適合做成人偶劇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我做企鵝先生好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬要做星星嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.40,0:14:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不怎麼會裁縫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很簡單啦 這樣做就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.27,0:14:11.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得自己辦不到的時候就要念一下樂觀小魔咒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.69,0:14:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起說「好的!」吧 秒秒鐘變成積極心態哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:21.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:23.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.77,0:14:26.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.70,0:14:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一針都真心投入就能看到幸福的陽光～
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.69,0:14:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.95,0:15:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 我睡著…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.68,0:15:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.81,0:16:09.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厲害啊 鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然一晚上就搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.87,0:16:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要我幫什麼忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.27,0:16:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.98,0:16:19.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬都這麼幫我了 我有必要獨自完成它
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.09,0:16:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 真要給我們表演人偶劇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:27.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看這個
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.27,0:16:30.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 那隻熊貓變成企鵝了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.49,0:16:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,企鵝先生奮鬥記…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.78,0:16:35.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開演了!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:22.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後 企鵝先生坐上星星 在空中向大家揮手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.68,0:17:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它很慶幸自己努力過了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.19,0:17:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.01,0:17:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好珍惜企鵝先生哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.20,0:17:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 大姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.93,0:17:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常成功啊 任務完成了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去告訴小毬醬
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:01.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這時 我突然想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.95,0:18:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄信人為什麼讓鈴演人偶劇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.68,0:18:12.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像他知道我們會遇到什麼事一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.45,0:18:15.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次也一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:19.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們解救學生食堂的危機的那封信
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在危機發生前就預言到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:27.48,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,這個世界裡存在著某種秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.73,0:18:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接著 一股奇妙的感覺湧上心頭
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.86,0:18:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我強烈感覺之前見過那本初次拜見的連環畫
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男孩子和女孩子會逐一解決8個小矮人的煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.96,0:18:50.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,煩惱消除後小矮人就會消失
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.74,0:18:57.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在某處…曾經見過
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.67,0:19:06.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:24.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小矮人們告完別 就消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.95,0:19:29.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬 小毬醬!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.65,0:20:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:26.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人偶劇 我演好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了呢 鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是小毬醬…的功勞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:41.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我剛才在向天邊的第一顆星許願
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「希望鈴醬能順利完成演出」
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向星星…許願?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.42,0:20:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個啊 也是許願星哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直戴著它 希望它保佑我願望成真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,願望…有兩個啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 對哈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我戴了兩顆 許兩個願也沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那這邊就算我的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.63,0:21:11.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一個就用來達成鈴醬的願望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.62,0:21:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:19.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明是小毬醬的星星 卻用來讓我許…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.86,0:21:22.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要許什麼願?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:27.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬幫我決定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:30.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 說好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:33.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了鈴醬 我會幫忙想好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.78,0:21:49.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定幫你想出個最棒的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:22:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第24話\N鈴醬幸福我也幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:22:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第24話\N鈴醬幸福我也幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:22:07.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第24話\N鈴醬幸福我也幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.19,0:23:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Little Busters的首次棒球賽終於來了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.87,0:23:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼夢話 這不還差名隊員嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.84,0:23:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只需要再拉一個人入隊…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.83,0:23:38.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任務 開始!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:54.00,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}ひとりが辛いから
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.09,0:02:57.16,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}ふたつの手をつないだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:03:03.74,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}ふたりじゃ寂しいから輪になって手をつないだ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:11.79,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}きっとそれが幾千の力にもなり
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:16.95,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}どんな夢も断てる気がするんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:20.63,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}高く飛べ　高く空へ　高く蹴れ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.74,0:03:23.57,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}高く声を上げ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.68,0:03:28.69,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}いつか挫けた　その日の向こうまで
